# Manual requests for Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (REST Client).
# Start the database (docker compose up -d db) and the API (dotnet run) first.
# Interactive docs: http://localhost:5080/scalar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Issue the next ticket -> 201 with { id, code, issuedAt }, or 409 once Z9 is issued
# @name issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets

### Get the ticket just issued
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/{{issue.response.body.$.id}}

### Unknown ticket -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/999999

### Current code of this round ("00" if none)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/current

### Reset the queue -> { "code": "00" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/reset

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
